# Session state — personal, regenerated per working session
session-state.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Handoff artifact: a byte-identical copy of this repo under repo/
Wozi.com theme conversion.zip

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Claude Code local state (agent worktrees, settings)
.claude/

# Measurement sheets, probes and one-off harnesses. Never published — the deploy
# is a whitelist — but they accumulate fast enough to bury a real diff in
# `git status`, which is where this repo checks whether a tree is clean.
scratchpad/

# Headless-Chrome user-data dirs the harnesses in tools/ create beside whatever
# script launched them (cp-shots, cp-chain, …). A profile is ~14MB of sqlite and
# cache across ~670 files, and a `git add -A` in a worktree swept exactly that
# into a commit once. Never wanted, never published, and large enough to matter.
cp-*/
